  </p>

  <h2 id="close-gap">What closes the gap for an analyst</h2>

  <p>
    If you are an analyst or plan to be one, four moves can change your pay faster than waiting for annual raises.
    Together they build the mix employers look for: skills, work you can show, clear communication and a clear place in the market.
  </p>

  <p>
    Communication belongs in that mix. Explaining a number clearly to a manager, in English or your own language, is part of what employers pay an analyst for.
  </p>

