      <strong>Scalable independent path.</strong> An engineer who takes contract work or builds a small tool, and an analyst who sets up and runs reporting
      for small businesses, can each set their own price and keep repeat clients. It scales because income stops depending on one employer's pay band.
    </p>
    <p>It also needs proof, trust and a first client, so treat it as a side route to test, not a promise.</p>
